{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51169","headline":"黄金台 · 岑义","name":"黄金台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雕墙峻字无不亡，蓟城筑宫国乃昌。\n屈身延士礼优异，四方英俊如云翔。\n郭生马喻真良策，亟卿拜乐卿爲上客。\n兵行旬日入临淄，秦楚诸君咸辟易。\n夙心已雪先王耻，七十齐城只余二。\n君王先去主帅逃，叹息後人非继志。\n巍台悲惨朔风号，不知骑劫何时招。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》二九《顺天府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑义","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}